    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-fĕrox</span></b> ,
		ōcis, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very fierce</i>, <i>bold</i>, <i>violent</i>, <i>impetuous</i>, <i>insolent</i> (perh. not
			ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeferoces legatos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 5,
					36</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 4, 60</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeferocem ingenio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					4, 32</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 23</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multiplici successu praeferocem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 35</span></i>
			.</div>
